<x-store.content-page title="Returns &amp; exchanges" heading="Returns &amp; exchanges" crumb="Returns" page="returns"
  lede="Wrong size? Swap it free within 14 days."
  :toc="['#swap' => 'Wrong size? Swap it free', '#refunds' => 'Refunds', '#faulty' => 'Faulty items', '#exclusions' => 'What we can\'t take back']">
  <h2 id="swap">Wrong size? Swap it free. <a class="anchor" href="#swap" aria-label="Link to this section"><svg class="icon icon--16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
  <p>Exchange any unworn, unwashed item with its tags on within 14 days of delivery. We cover the return courier cost on size swaps — message us on WhatsApp with your order number and we'll arrange the pick-up.</p>

  <h2 id="refunds">Refunds <a class="anchor" href="#refunds" aria-label="Link to this section"><svg class="icon icon--16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
  <p>If you'd rather a refund than a swap, we'll refund the item price within 7 days of receiving it back. Delivery fees are not refunded unless the item was faulty or we sent the wrong thing.</p>

  <h2 id="faulty">Faulty items <a class="anchor" href="#faulty" aria-label="Link to this section"><svg class="icon icon--16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
  <p>Send us a photo within 7 days and we'll replace or refund it, including delivery, no questions asked.</p>

  <h2 id="exclusions">What we can't take back <a class="anchor" href="#exclusions" aria-label="Link to this section"><svg class="icon icon--16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
  <p>For hygiene, we can't accept returns on items that have been worn or washed, or on sale items marked final.</p>
</x-store.content-page>
